# Production build values for apps/web. Vite reads this automatically during
# `vite build`, so the deployed bundle points at the live API without anything
# needing to be configured in the Vercel dashboard.
#
# This is a public URL, not a secret — everything VITE_-prefixed is compiled into
# the JavaScript bundle. Real secrets belong to apps/api on Render.
#
# Without this, apiBaseUrl falls back to same-origin "/api", which does not exist
# on the static Vercel deployment. The /health probe then fails and the app drops
# into local mode, where uploads are saved to IndexedDB and never processed.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://aftercare-api.onrender.com
